Subject: [PATCH] qcom-ptool: update qcom-ptool revision

The following changes were merged in qcom-ptool:

Igor Opaniuk (3):
      loaders: add named GPT attribute fields to the YAML source
      tests: pin conf/yaml parity for the named attribute fields
      CONTRIBUTING: require YAML schema parity for new loader options

Ricardo Salveti (1):
      qrb2210-unoq-abl: provide a pre-edk2 version of partition tables

Vivek Puar (1):
      platforms/shikra-evk: add missing SYSFW_VERSION partition

Wenwen Fu (1):
      gen_udev_rules: derive raw rules from partition layouts

Upstream-Status: Submitted [https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/meta-qcom/pull/3242]

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Ricardo Salveti <ricardo.salveti@oss.qualcomm.com>
